menu "SempreIoT leaf manager (siot_leafmgr)"

    config SIOT_FEATURE_LEAFMGR
        bool "Parent role for battery leafs on this node (protocol section 12.11)"
        default n
        help
            Answers a leaf's HEARTBEAT / EVENT with the 9-byte leaf ACK
            (PENDING, NO_PATH, EPOCH, CHANNEL), forwards its frames into the
            mesh, takes custody of its events until the board's ACK, keeps a
            mailbox of downlink frames for it while it sleeps and delivers
            them on its next wake. Node image only.

    config SIOT_LEAFMGR_MAX_LEAVES
        int "Leafs this node keeps state for"
        depends on SIOT_FEATURE_LEAFMGR
        default 16
        range 1 64
        help
            About 1.2 KB each (mailbox of 4 frames). Entries silent for 180 s
            are dropped, so the number bounds concurrent leafs, not lifetime.

endmenu
